{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53401","headline":"登石伞峰 · 齐推","name":"登石伞峰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"能以郡中暇，不遗尘外踪。\n啸俦得鸳鸯，探策入云松。\n缘径历空际，望崖来剑峰。\n况当会天人，复此陈歌钟。\n贱子固多癖，偶兹安一峰。\n步林欣有适，筑室幸可容。\n宁期樵牧处，忽与轩盖逢。\n仰荷高兴属，俯慙危磴重。\n攀幽破岩霭，践滑触苔封。\n秋景山光动，寒丛菊艳浓。\n赏心惬觞酌，逸韵陶襟胸。\n仍叨勒名字，永纪今所从。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐推","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}